Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：III的新 No. 阿特兰塔尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那强大的力量毫不留情地向我袭来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算星光体消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也在我心中！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我绝对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能输！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（III）这样一来 你的生命值就只剩２００了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来给你最后一击吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会放弃。 为了将希望托付给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合… 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《看着吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是 我真正的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个… 你留给我的另一张力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会让它白费！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值 不足１０００的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以作为超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌化为光明的使者…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.31,0:01:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）来了 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:49.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）猫棒哦 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出现了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《霍普雷… 如果是你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定能 唤醒的眼睛》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动墓地中叠光吞噬者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的 这张卡除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.90,0:03:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方超量怪兽的一个叠光单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收到自己的超量怪兽上！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.91,0:03:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！ 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亚特兰塔的效果就用不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 发动霍普雷的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一个叠光单位 这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把希望皇霍普雷的超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3个全部用掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.67,0:03:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.82,0:03:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这个效果还会让亚特兰塔尔的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1个超量素材下降1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.65,0:03:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体明明不在怎么会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:03:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 他在！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.81,0:04:01.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的心中！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的一飞冲天之中！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是他让我变得更强！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.08,0:04:14.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度的展开我早就读到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡！ 雷壶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以 将针对欧帕兹怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效化 并强制结束战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 游马的攻击…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是希望皇的攻击看来也伤不到我呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.47,0:04:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还没放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.99,0:04:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真不死心啊，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，双方怪兽的攻击力恢复原状的现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你已经没有胜算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽…唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是托隆所说的…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆：听好了？…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得到这枚纹章的力量之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能操纵 No.6 大西洋甲虫。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在赋予你强大力量的同时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会对你的精神与肉体造成巨大的负担。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.54,0:05:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 没… 没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要赢过游马回应你的期待…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信你哦，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）你是个坚强的孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这就是 No.卡代价？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我难道 没法操控这张 No.卡吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 我一定要回应托隆的期待！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么 那家伙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马！ 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什… 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放单位 为零的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿特兰塔尔 会在回合开始时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将双方玩家的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个狠角色…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至不惜削减自己的生命值……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.45,0:06:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值还没耗尽呢，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……你，那是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别管我……游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是我所期望得到的力量的代价……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，哪怕这副身躯被撕裂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也……我也绝对要守护家人！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用这一击，我要赢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，亚特兰塔尔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击霍普雷！神圣惩罚！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）糟了……接下这一击的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.84,0:07:48.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马就输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡。战斗中断！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在对方怪兽攻击过来时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强制结束战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:07:58.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并破坏那只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:07:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.69,0:08:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆：你忍得很好，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。按照约定。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡和这张卡也一起给你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安格尔摩亚……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张陷阱卡是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是护身符一样的东西吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那张卡是毁灭之卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦使用，对手和你都不会安然无恙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}万一的时候为了那一刻，我先交给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）不管用什么手段
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都会赢给我看的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢过那个游马
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}永续陷阱 安哥尔摩亚 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏自己场上的装备卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 将对手的陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:08:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至不惜降低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.24,0:09:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亚特兰塔尔的攻击力 也要破坏我的陷阱……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}足够了 就凭这一击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的生命值 只剩１００。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亚特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同霍普雷一起把游马轰飞！！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 半·安布雷克！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 保护霍普雷不被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.20,0:09:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将对玩家的伤害减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩余生命值 50。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 你难道还。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.17,0:09:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:10:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.62,0:10:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识我真正的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手吧 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.58,0:10:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不是已经成为朋友了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我不需要什么朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想跟你聊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你一起聊你的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有我爸的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.45,0:10:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 已经太迟了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我现在 发动的陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安哥尔摩亚是毁灭之卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个我的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将破坏的棉花糖的攻击力数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转化为对你和我造成的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，在我的下一个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们会受到2400的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被吹飞。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，这可不是单纯的同归于尽就能了事的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟我们可是 No.卡持有者之间
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.89,0:11:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展开了如此激烈的战斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.43,0:11:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，我无所谓。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果牺牲我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能回应特隆的期待的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我的家人能恢复原状的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}，你……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂、喂，那个黑暗不断逼近过来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.59,0:11:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总感觉，好不妙啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁、铁男君，这是AR啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在现实里 这种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是 难 难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现实……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不妙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去我们就要……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不对劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这难道是次元之门。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将一切引向毁灭的卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭我纹章的力量 压制不住。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会 安哥尔摩亚的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.59,0:12:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是毁灭这个世界的力量吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 是用了那张卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）难道说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.16,0:13:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}您把那张卡交给{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安哥尔摩亚能生成通往异晶界之门的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦发动就无法阻止。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 再这样下去异次元之门就会打开{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.13,0:13:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不光是我和你。 不，是所有的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:34.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都会被吸进去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救救我啊乌拉 我不要这样啊乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我 可从来没
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望世界毁灭啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原谅我吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.03,0:13:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才 你说再这样下去{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异次元之门就会打开对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那我就用决斗赢了你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.47,0:14:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那玩意儿停下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能的！ 阿托兰塔尔会随着我的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当降到1000以下时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中不会被破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.63,0:14:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我也不会受到战斗伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们已经完了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没结束呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能放弃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊如果是星光体的话，还打算赢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是ZEXAL。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}ZEXAL？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.41,0:14:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是我和星光体引发的奇迹之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.53,0:14:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是那家伙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，也许能唤回星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唤回星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个纹章的力量让星光体消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么，就把这份力量注入你体内！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……那么那家伙会回来吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这枚纹章的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.61,0:15:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你未必能控制得住。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己说不定会被这股力量吞噬。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.79,0:15:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我无所谓！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要星光体能回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 把你的力量给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《就算能把纹章的力量赋予游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我恐怕也……》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.59,0:15:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.30,0:15:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.89,0:15:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区纹章的力量算什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）你是。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.17,0:16:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（一马）星光体 我的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.54,0:16:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在呼唤。　去帮帮他吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:17:00.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体　你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我听到了你的声音。　要赢啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.99,0:17:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你…　你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的　总是那么拽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.43,0:17:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　星光体别管我，打倒这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马　泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！　上吧　星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　由我自己和你　叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两个人构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么　这到底是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.86,0:18:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当遥远的两个灵魂交汇之时传承之力将会显现。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.86,0:18:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和星光体合体了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗 全都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽到的卡 也是由决斗者创造的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）来吧！泽阿尔武器！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）不死鸟之弓！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.75,0:18:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）这只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以装备到霍普雷身上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.35,0:18:40.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了它的霍普雷向对手攻击的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将战斗伤害无效
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成1000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.96,0:19:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击亚特兰塔尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:12.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）不死鸟终结！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）这就是 游马和星光体的羁绊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.07,0:19:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能！{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.65,0:19:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）这里就是原来的地方啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）也就是说，到头来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们得救了呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……赢了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.81,0:20:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我应该说过，要赢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对……对了，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道的，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你认可了真实的我。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.51,0:20:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是我最初也是最后的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我有个请求。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能救救我的家人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.88,0:20:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是你的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.90,0:20:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是你的一飞冲天的话，一定……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.88,0:21:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，五块心之碎片就集齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进决赛了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……你的心意，我不会让它白费！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，决斗嘉年华！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.37,0:21:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）没关系的，{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能握住我的手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你能一直握着。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得，好困……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}晚安。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会一直，在你身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好休息吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.16,0:22:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一马的儿子……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}痒痒节奏 天甜甜甜拍 迷迷迷旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全因都是等级３{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.87,0:24:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据战况
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.67,0:24:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能获得效果哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 痒天迷魔人。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.26,0:24:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多少给我记住点效果。

